.* QUIDSPPTF: DSPPTF, the fixes applied to a product; WRKPTFGRP; the
.* cover letters of DSPPTFCVR (list and letter, laid out from IBM's
.* documentation: no system the oracle reaches has a cover letter).
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=RLSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 25'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ACTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ACTCL2 BASETYPE='CHAR 20'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 40'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=GRPCL BASETYPE='CHAR 20'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LVLCL BASETYPE='CHAR 5'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=IDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 7'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STS2CL BASETYPE='CHAR 43'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ACT3CL BASETYPE='CHAR 6'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ATRCL BASETYPE='CHAR 9'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LINECL BASETYPE='CHAR 76'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=PRODID CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=IPLSRC CLASS=TEXTCL VALUE='##MACH#A'.
:VAR NAME=RELEASE CLASS=RLSCL.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PTFID CLASS=IDCL.
:VAR NAME=PTFSTS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=PTFACT CLASS=ACTCL2.
:VAR NAME=PTFOPT CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PTFRLS CLASS=RLSCL.
:VAR NAME=DELAYED CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=LICPTF CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SAVF CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=SUPERSEDE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PREREQ CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=COREQ CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=GRPNAME CLASS=GRPCL.
:VAR NAME=GRPLVL CLASS=LVLCL.
:VAR NAME=GRPSTS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=GRPTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=CVRATR CLASS=ATRCL.
:VAR NAME=CVRLINE CLASS=LINECL.
:LISTDEF NAME=PTFS VARS='OPT PTFID PSTS PACT'.
:LISTDEF NAME=CVRS VARS='OPT PTFID PRODID PTFRLS PTFSTS CVRATR'.
:LISTDEF NAME=LINES VARS='CVRLINE'.
:VAR NAME=GOPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:CLASS NAME=VIEWCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=PTFVIEW CLASS=VIEWCL VALUE='1'.
:VAR NAME=PSTS CLASS=STS2CL.
:VAR NAME=PACT CLASS=ACT3CL.
:LISTDEF NAME=GRPS VARS='GOPT GRPNAME GRPLVL GRPSTS GRPTEXT'.
:KEYL NAME=DKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=CKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
.* F11 under two conditions keeps a second key row, blank, as the
.* 7.1 display does; the blanks in the PTF ID heading wrap it.
:COND NAME=PVIEW1 EXPR='&PTFVIEW. EQ "1"'.
:COND NAME=PVIEW2 EXPR='&PTFVIEW. EQ "2"'.
:KEYL NAME=PKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=PVIEW1.F11=Display alternate view
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=PVIEW2.F11=Display alternate view
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION='RETURN 17'.F17=Position to
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=GKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F6 ACTION='RETURN 6'.F6=Print
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display descriptions
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F22 ACTION='RETURN 22'.F22=Display entire field
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPPTF KEYL=PKEYS HELP=DSPPTFH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Display PTF Status
:DATA DEPTH=5.
:DATACOL WIDTH=39.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=PRODID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRODID'.Product ID
:DATAI VAR=IPLSRC USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/IPLSRC'.IPL source
:DATAI VAR=RELEASE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RELEASE'.Release of base option
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PTFS ACTLEN=1 SCROLL=YES.(No PTFs have been applied to this release.)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105' HELP='DSPPTF/OPTIONS'.5=Display PTF details
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='CMD DSPPTFCVR LICPGM(&PRODID.) SELECT(&PTFID.) OUTPUT(*PRINT)' HELP='DSPPTF/OPTIONS'.6=Print cover letter
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD DSPPTFCVR LICPGM(&PRODID.) SELECT(&PTFID.)' HELP='DSPPTF/OPTIONS'.8=Display cover letter
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='DSPPTF/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=PTFID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PTFID'.PTF     ID
:LISTCOL VAR=PSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=PACT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PACT'.IPL Action
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPPTFD KEYL=DKEYS HELP=DSPPTFDH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display PTF Details
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATACOL WIDTH=40.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=PTFID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PTFID'.PTF identifier
:DATAI VAR=PRODID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRODID'.Product ID
:DATAI VAR=PTFOPT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PTFOPT'.Option
:DATAI VAR=PTFRLS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PTFRLS'.Release
:DATAI VAR=PTFSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PTFSTS'.Status
:DATAI VAR=PTFACT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PTFACT'.IPL action
:DATAI VAR=DELAYED USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DELAYED'.Delayed until the next IPL
:DATAI VAR=LICPTF USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LICPTF'.Licensed Internal Code fix
:DATAI VAR=SAVF USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SAVF'.Save file
:DATAI VAR=SUPERSEDE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SUPERSEDE'.Superseded by
:DATAI VAR=PREREQ USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PREREQ'.Prerequisite PTFs
:DATAI VAR=COREQ USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/COREQ'.Co-requisite PTFs
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKPTFGRP KEYL=GKEYS HELP=WRKPTFGRPH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with PTF Groups
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=GRPS VIEWS=2 SCROLL=YES.(No PTF groups found.)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='RETURN 101' HELP='WRKPTFGRP/OPTIONS'.1=Order
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 104' HELP='WRKPTFGRP/OPTIONS'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105' HELP='WRKPTFGRP/OPTIONS'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='RETURN 106' HELP='WRKPTFGRP/OPTIONS'.6=Print
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='RETURN 108' HELP='WRKPTFGRP/OPTIONS'.8=Display special handling PTFs
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='RETURN 109' HELP='WRKPTFGRP/OPTIONS'.9=Display related PTF groups
:LISTCOL VAR=GOPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='WRKPTFGRP/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=GRPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/GRPNAME'.PTF Group
:LISTCOL VAR=GRPLVL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/GRPLVL'.Level
:LISTCOL VAR=GRPSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/GRPSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=GRPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/GRPTEXT'.Text
:LISTVIEW COLS='GOPT GRPNAME GRPLVL GRPSTS'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='GOPT GRPNAME GRPTEXT'.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=SELCVR KEYL=CKEYS HELP=SELCVRH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Select Cover Letter
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=CVRS SCROLL=YES.(No cover letters)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105' HELP='SELCVR/OPTIONS'.5=Display cover letter
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='RETURN 106' HELP='SELCVR/OPTIONS'.6=Print cover letter
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='SELCVR/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=PTFID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PTFID'.PTF ID
:LISTCOL VAR=PRODID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRODID'.Product
:LISTCOL VAR=PTFRLS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PTFRLS'.Release
:LISTCOL VAR=PTFSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PTFSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=CVRATR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CVRATR'.Attribute
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPCVR KEYL=CKEYS HELP=DSPCVRH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display PTF Cover Letter
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATAI VAR=PTFID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PTFID'.PTF identifier
:DATAI VAR=PRODID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRODID'.Product
:DATAI VAR=PTFRLS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PTFRLS'.Release
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LINES SCROLL=YES.
:LISTCOL VAR=CVRLINE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CVRLINE'.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=SELCVRH.Select Cover Letter - Help
:P.The PTFs whose cover letters matched the selection. Option 5 shows a
letter, option 6 prints it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPCVRH.Display PTF Cover Letter - Help
:P.The cover letter that came with the PTF: what it fixes and what to do
before or after applying it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPPTFDH.Display PTF Details - Help
:P.What the PTF database holds for one fix: where it came from, whether
it is applied, what the next IPL does to it and the fixes it needs.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=WRKPTFGRPH.Work with PTF Groups - Help
:P.The PTF groups on the system, the level of each and whether every
fix of the group is applied.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPPTFH.Display PTF Status - Help
:P.The program temporary fixes of the product and whether each is
applied, with what the next IPL does to it. Option 5 shows what the
PTF database holds for one of them.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 and F12 leave, F11 shows the other view of a list.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRODID'.Product ID
:P.A product identifier&colon. seven characters, 5770SS1 for example.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/IPLSRC'.IPL source
:P.The IPL source shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RELEASE'.Release of base option
:P.The release of base option shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DSPPTF/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PTFID'.PTF     ID
:P.The PTF ID of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PSTS'.Status
:P.The status of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PACT'.IPL Action
:P.The IPL Action of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DSPPTF/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.5=Display PTF details
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display PTF details it.
:PT.6=Print cover letter
:PD.Type 6 next to an entry and press Enter to print cover letter it.
The Display PTF Cover Letter (DSPPTFCVR) command runs for the entry.
:PT.8=Display cover letter
:PD.Type 8 next to an entry and press Enter to display cover letter it.
The Display PTF Cover Letter (DSPPTFCVR) command runs for the entry.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PTFOPT'.Option
:P.The option shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PTFRLS'.Release
:P.A release, in the form VxRyMz.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PTFSTS'.Status
:P.The status shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PTFACT'.IPL action
:P.The IPL action shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DELAYED'.Delayed until the next IPL
:P.The delayed until the next IPL shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LICPTF'.Licensed Internal Code fix
:P.The licensed Internal Code fix shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SAVF'.Save file
:P.The save file, by name and library.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SUPERSEDE'.Superseded by
:P.The superseded by shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PREREQ'.Prerequisite PTFs
:P.The prerequisite PTFs shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/COREQ'.Co-requisite PTFs
:P.The co-requisite PTFs shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKPTFGRP/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/GRPNAME'.PTF Group
:P.The PTF Group of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/GRPLVL'.Level
:P.The level of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/GRPSTS'.Status
:P.The status of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/GRPTEXT'.Text
:P.The text of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKPTFGRP/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.1=Order
:PD.Type 1 next to an entry and press Enter to order it.
:PT.4=Delete
:PD.Type 4 next to an entry and press Enter to delete it.
:PT.5=Display
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display it.
:PT.6=Print
:PD.Type 6 next to an entry and press Enter to print it.
:PT.8=Display special handling PTFs
:PD.Type 8 next to an entry and press Enter to display special handling
PTFs it.
:PT.9=Display related PTF groups
:PD.Type 9 next to an entry and press Enter to display related PTF
groups it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SELCVR/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CVRATR'.Attribute
:P.The attribute of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SELCVR/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.5=Display cover letter
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display cover letter it.
:PT.6=Print cover letter
:PD.Type 6 next to an entry and press Enter to print cover letter it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CVRLINE'.CVRLINE
:P.The CVRLINE of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
